#N canvas 120 60 900 460 12;
#X text 20 10 fs_drone_point <name> <root_midi> - drone for a sensor-fusion sensor (needs the Pi's Orientation + Magnitude stages): point up for higher notes (elevation -60..60 deg) \; rotation speed (corrected_gyro_mag 30..400 deg/s) swells it \; twist your wrist to open or close the filter. Twist is mapped through a sine around a center angle \, so it is smooth all the way round (no jump at +-180): center = mid brightness \, +90 = brightest \, -90 = darkest. Left inlet: scale messages. Right inlet: twist center in degrees (default 0)., f 110;
#X obj 20 130 fs_in \$1 elevation;
#X obj 20 160 fs_map -60 60 0 1;
#X obj 300 130 fs_in \$1 corrected_gyro_mag;
#X obj 300 160 fs_map 30 400 0 1;
#X obj 560 130 fs_in \$1 twist;
#X obj 560 190 expr (1 + sin(($f1 - $f2) * 3.14159265 / 180)) / 2;
#X obj 20 270 fs_drone_voice \$2;
#X obj 20 310 outlet~;
#X obj 180 130 inlet;
#X obj 760 130 inlet;
#X connect 1 0 2 0;
#X connect 2 0 7 0;
#X connect 3 0 4 0;
#X connect 4 0 7 1;
#X connect 5 0 6 0;
#X connect 6 0 7 2;
#X connect 7 0 8 0;
#X connect 9 0 7 0;
#X connect 10 0 6 1;
